    "title": "Belmont Pier Beatdown Leaves Long Beach Paletero Sidelined - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Juliette Kessler ,\n6 hours ago Long Beach paletero Eliu Ramirez says he is off his cart and out of work after a July 4 beating at Belmont Pier that left him with a fractured nose and vision problems. Ramirez told reporters the trouble started when someone told him he was not allowed to sell at the pier, and that several men later returned and assaulted him. A community fundraiser is now helping his family cover expenses while he recovers. Read full article\n3",
